## Editing files externally

Most content here is written by agents. To hand-edit:

```bash
osascript -e 'quit app "Obsidian"' && sleep 2
rm -f ".obsidian/workspace.json" ".obsidian/workspace-mobile.json"
# ... make edits ...
open -a Obsidian
```

Files under agent folders may be overwritten on the next tick.

